%!PS
% A small "photograph": a radial sky, a sun and hills, for JPEG fixtures.
<< /PageSize [96 64] >> setpagedevice
<< /ShadingType 3 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB /Coords [70 50 0 48 32 70] /Extend [true true]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1 0.95 0.7] /C1 [0.2 0.45 0.85] /N 1 >> >> shfill
1 0.8 0.2 setrgbcolor 70 48 9 0 360 arc fill
0.15 0.5 0.2 setrgbcolor 0 0 moveto 0 22 lineto 30 34 60 18 96 26 curveto 96 0 lineto fill
0.1 0.35 0.15 setrgbcolor 0 0 moveto 0 12 lineto 40 20 70 6 96 14 curveto 96 0 lineto fill
showpage
